    "catalogue": "Residential FTTH Last-Mile Termination — Delivering high-speed fiber broadband connectivity to residential homes and apartments through Fiber-to-the-Home (FTTH) networks, enabling reliable internet access, IPTV, VoIP services, and seamless connectivity for smart home devices and everyday digital applications.\nSmall Office / Retail Fiber Connectivity — Ideal for providing reliable, high-speed fiber internet connectivity to small offices, retail stores, and branch locations, enabling seamless POS transactions, cloud application access, VoIP communication, and secure data transmission for uninterrupted business operations.\nMDU (Multi-Dwelling Unit) Bulk Rollouts — Deploying high-speed fiber broadband connectivity across apartments, residential complexes, and multi-tenant buildings, enabling scalable network installations, centralized management, and reliable internet, IPTV, and VoIP services for multiple households through a shared fiber infrastructure."
